{"duration": 49.625, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A doctor made Londoners rip off a pump handle as cholera spread.", "start": 0.05, "end": 2.823}, {"beat": 1, "text": "The prevailing theory blamed foul air, not dirty water.", "start": 3.023, "end": 5.711}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Even Snow's water test failed to prove the danger.", "start": 5.791, "end": 8.245}, {"beat": 1, "text": "London's lead medical officer called Snow's germ theory strange.", "start": 8.325, "end": 11.364}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Cholera killed 420 people in Soho.", "start": 11.564, "end": 13.953}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Snow questioned residents with help from Reverend Henry Whitehead.", "start": 14.033, "end": 16.892}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Deaths clustered around the Broad Street pump.", "start": 16.972, "end": 18.871}, {"beat": 2, "text": "In September 1854, parish guardians pulled the handle off the pump.", "start": 18.951, "end": 22.657}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it's like everyone sick after a party drank the same punch.", "start": 22.857, "end": 25.897}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The pump's well sat three feet from a leaking cesspit, a waste pit.", "start": 26.097, "end": 28.917}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Waste water from a baby's washed nappy seeped into that pit.", "start": 28.997, "end": 31.749}, {"beat": 4, "text": "So pump water carried sewage germs into people's stomachs.", "start": 31.829, "end": 34.334}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Brewery workers drank boiled beer instead, and none caught cholera.", "start": 34.414, "end": 37.555}, {"beat": 5, "text": "But Snow warned the outbreak was already shrinking.", "start": 37.755, "end": 39.952}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Afterward, officials put the handle back and rejected his theory.", "start": 40.032, "end": 43.04}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The citywide epidemic went on to kill nearly 3,000 people.", "start": 43.12, "end": 46.384}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Yet a plaque there now shows the pump with no handle.", "start": 46.464, "end": 48.725}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.165, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "doctor", "start": 0.19, "end": 0.39, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "made", "start": 0.415, "end": 0.54, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Londoners", "start": 0.59, "end": 0.94, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "rip", "start": 0.99, "end": 1.09, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "off", "start": 1.115, "end": 1.215, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.24, "end": 1.265, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "pump", "start": 1.315, "end": 1.465, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "handle", "start": 1.49, "end": 1.815, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "as", "start": 1.865, "end": 1.915, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "cholera", "start": 1.965, "end": 2.215, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "spread.", "start": 2.265, "end": 2.823, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "The", "start": 3.067, "end": 3.117, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "prevailing", "start": 3.142, "end": 3.417, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "theory", "start": 3.467, "end": 3.692, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "blamed", "start": 3.742, "end": 3.942, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "foul", "start": 4.017, "end": 4.242, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "air,", "start": 4.292, "end": 4.717, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "not", "start": 4.767, "end": 4.892, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "dirty", "start": 4.942, "end": 5.167, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "water.", "start": 5.217, "end": 5.711, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Even", "start": 5.86, "end": 6.01, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Snow's", "start": 6.06, "end": 6.31, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "water", "start": 6.36, "end": 6.535, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "test", "start": 6.585, "end": 6.91, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "failed", "start": 7.01, "end": 7.21, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "to", "start": 7.235, "end": 7.285, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "prove", "start": 7.335, "end": 7.485, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "the", "start": 7.51, "end": 7.56, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "danger.", "start": 7.61, "end"